{"4274990":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Minibus Simulator","steam_appid":4274990,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🚐 Minibus Simulator<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own minibus business and experience the daily rhythm of the city behind the wheel.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up passengers from bus stops, deliver them safely and on time, and grow your minibus career step by step.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But driving is only part of the job.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will leave your vehicle, load passenger luggage, refuel your minibus, change tires and take care of your vehicle like a real driver.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎮 Steering Wheel Support<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steering wheels and pedal sets are supported through the in-game setup wizard, where you assign your own axes and buttons.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tested with Logitech G29, Logitech Formula and MOZA R5. Other devices usually work, but some wheels must be switched to D-input (DirectInput) mode and may need the manufacturer's driver installed.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎓 Get Your License and Become a Minibus Driver<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your minibus career starts at home.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Go to the training center and pass the driving tests<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Get your minibus driver license<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Take a loan from the bank<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Visit the dealership and buy your first minibus suitable for your level<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now it's time to get behind the wheel.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4274990\/extras\/511368572b4c80c75472cc591ce9aa7e.avif?t=1792864901\" width=799 height=449 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>👥 Pick Up Passengers and Start Earning<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Choose a route and start your engine<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Pick up passengers from bus stops<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Deliver them safely and on time to their destination<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some passengers travel with luggage.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can earn extra money by getting out of the vehicle and loading their bags into the trunk yourself.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also take standing passengers to increase your income…<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >…but be careful.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚓 If the police catch you during an inspection, you might get fined.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4274990\/extras\/c97d6499c0c6deb0ca38ea3f314e8ae0.poster.avif?t=1792864901\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4274990\/extras\/c97d6499c0c6deb0ca38ea3f314e8ae0.webm?t=1792864901\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4274990\/extras\/c97d6499c0c6deb0ca38ea3f314e8ae0.mp4?t=1792864901\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⭐ Progress and Grow Your Business<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete tasks, level up and grow your business.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Unlock new minibuses<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Work on more profitable routes<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🔧 Take Care of Your Vehicle<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your minibus is your livelihood.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Take it to service when maintenance is needed<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Refuel it yourself and pay at the market<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Rough roads may damage your tires<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a tire bursts:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Buy a new tire from the tire shop<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Replace it yourself on the vehicle<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dusty roads will make your minibus dirty.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want, you can:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚿 Wash it yourself with a pressure washer<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚗 Or use an automatic car wash<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember…<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you take good care of your minibus, it will take good care of your business.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4274990\/extras\/6291441c02e4ec1c68da55f15fcf1a19.poster.avif?t=1792864901\" width=1170 height=628 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4274990\/extras\/6291441c02e4ec1c68da55f15fcf1a19.webm?t=1792864901\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4274990\/extras\/6291441c02e4ec1c68da55f15fcf1a19.mp4?t=1792864901\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚐 Expand Your Fleet<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the money you earn to buy new vehicles.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Carry more passengers with larger minibuses<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the best minibus driver in the city.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🗺️ Explore the World<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large map with different atmospheres awaits you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• City center<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Coastal roads<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Peaceful villages<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Forest routes<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Holiday districts<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get behind the wheel — or step out and explore the world on foot. <\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🚐 Minibus Simulator<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own minibus business and experience the daily rhythm of the city behind the wheel.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up passengers from bus stops, deliver them safely and on time, and grow your minibus career step by step.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But driving is only part of the job.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will leave your vehicle, load passenger luggage, refuel your minibus, change tires and take care of your vehicle like a real driver.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎮 Steering Wheel Support<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steering wheels and pedal sets are supported through the in-game setup wizard, where you assign your own axes and buttons.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tested with Logitech G29, Logitech Formula and MOZA R5. Other devices usually work, but some wheels must be switched to D-input (DirectInput) mode and may need the manufacturer's driver installed.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎓 Get Your License and Become a Minibus Driver<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your minibus career starts at home.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Go to the training center and pass the driving tests<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Get your minibus driver license<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Take a loan from the bank<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Visit the dealership and buy your first minibus suitable for your level<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now it's time to get behind the wheel.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4274990\/extras\/511368572b4c80c75472cc591ce9aa7e.avif?t=1792864901\" width=799 height=449 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>👥 Pick Up Passengers and Start Earning<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Choose a route and start your engine<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Pick up passengers from bus stops<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Deliver them safely and on time to their destination<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some passengers travel with luggage.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can earn extra money by getting out of the vehicle and loading their bags into the trunk yourself.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also take standing passengers to increase your income…<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >…but be careful.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚓 If the police catch you during an inspection, you might get fined.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4274990\/extras\/c97d6499c0c6deb0ca38ea3f314e8ae0.poster.avif?t=1792864901\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4274990\/extras\/c97d6499c0c6deb0ca38ea3f314e8ae0.webm?t=1792864901\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4274990\/extras\/c97d6499c0c6deb0ca38ea3f314e8ae0.mp4?t=1792864901\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⭐ Progress and Grow Your Business<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete tasks, level up and grow your business.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Unlock new minibuses<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Work on more profitable routes<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🔧 Take Care of Your Vehicle<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your minibus is your livelihood.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Take it to service when maintenance is needed<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Refuel it yourself and pay at the market<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Rough roads may damage your tires<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a tire bursts:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Buy a new tire from the tire shop<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Replace it yourself on the vehicle<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dusty roads will make your minibus dirty.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want, you can:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚿 Wash it yourself with a pressure washer<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚗 Or use an automatic car wash<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember…<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you take good care of your minibus, it will take good care of your business.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4274990\/extras\/6291441c02e4ec1c68da55f15fcf1a19.poster.avif?t=1792864901\" width=1170 height=628 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4274990\/extras\/6291441c02e4ec1c68da55f15fcf1a19.webm?t=1792864901\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4274990\/extras\/6291441c02e4ec1c68da55f15fcf1a19.mp4?t=1792864901\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚐 Expand Your Fleet<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the money you earn to buy new vehicles.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Carry more passengers with larger minibuses<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the best minibus driver in the city.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🗺️ Explore the World<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large map with different atmospheres awaits you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• City center<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Coastal roads<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Peaceful villages<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Forest routes<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Holiday districts<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get behind the wheel — or step out and explore the world on foot. 